                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "x": 0.28,
              "y": 0.52,
              "zoom": 1.6,
              "text": "**Behind them, a cloud of weedkiller.** The best known is called Agent Orange. Nearly 80 million liters are sprayed in ten years."
            },
            {
              "x": 0.62,
              "y": 0.88,
              "zoom": 2,
              "text": "**Below, fields and trees.** The goal: strip the leaves and destroy the crops. About 20% of the South's forests are hit, and the health effects are still felt today."
            }
